[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1440PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Captions-207-,Chinacat,99,&H00FFFFFF,&H000019FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,5,0,1,3.4,0,2,16,16,27,1Style: Credits-207-,FOT-Greco Std B Strp,50,&H00FFFFFF,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,95,100,1.6,0,1,3,0,7,16,16,16,1Style: Main-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Secondary-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Thoughts-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.4,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Title-207-,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H00002EFF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,23,23,383,1Style: Flashbacks-207-,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Note-207-,Impress BT Pace,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H96000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,3,8,300,300,27,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,8,23,23,23,1Style: Kanji,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,8,23,23,146,1Style: Kanji-furigana,Duality,60,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.375,0,8,23,23,225,1Style: Translation,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,2,23,23,34,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:01:54.01,0:01:55.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi!Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.51,0:01:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, you...!Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.35,0:02:02.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aim!Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.15,0:02:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Stop!Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.94,0:02:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fighting won't help anyone!Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.86,0:02:15.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm fine! It only grazed my arm!Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.41,0:02:21.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As you wish, we will not land here!Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.12,0:02:22.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But can you send us a doctor?Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.50,0:02:25.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our crewmate is gravely ill!Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.63,0:02:27.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please help us! I beg you!Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi!Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.51,0:02:33.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not fit to be captain, Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.63,0:02:36.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not everything can be fixed by acting on impulse!Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.35,0:02:44.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you start a fight here, what will happen to Nami-san?Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.15,0:02:55.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm sorry! I was wrong!Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.53,0:02:57.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please call a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please save our crew member.Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.17,0:03:13.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will show you to the village.Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.22,0:03:16.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Follow me.Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.23,0:03:25.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See? They understood!Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.89,0:03:28.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You're amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.70,0:03:45.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I must warn you, the only doctor we have in this country is a witch.Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.37,0:03:47.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A witch?Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.04,0:03:50.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me. Nothing here makes sense.Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What country is this, anyway?Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.26,0:03:57.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a nameless country.Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A nameless country?Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.89,0:04:01.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How does that happen?Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.31,0:04:06.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A bear!Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.23,0:04:09.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Play dead!Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.69,0:04:14.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A hiking bear. They pose no danger.Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.48,0:04:16.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please bow; it's proper hiking etiquette.Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.70,0:04:24.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! Good as new!Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.79,0:04:26.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.62,0:04:31.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I can finally get back to some real training!Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.83,0:04:35.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was getting sick of my watered-down regimen,Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and guarding the ship is just boring.Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.80,0:04:43.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Training in frigid water is an excellent exercise in mindlessness.Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.64,0:04:51.90,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,This is our village, Bighorn.Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.19,0:04:55.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's with the weird animals walking around?Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.57,0:04:57.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a snow country for you!Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.61,0:05:01.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! We made it to a village with people! A village!Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thanks for the help, everyone.Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those not on guard duty can return to their work.Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.12,0:05:10.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, will you be okay by yourself, Dalton-san?Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.75,0:05:12.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.25,0:05:13.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I do not believe they mean us any harm.Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.88,0:05:17.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My hunch comes from experience. Trust me.Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.59,0:05:21.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that's what Dalton-san says, then...Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.30,0:05:18.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san...Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.38,0:05:24.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And they don't seem dangerous...Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.22,0:05:24.18,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.85,0:05:27.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, Dalton-san! We'll leave the rest to you!Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.31,0:05:29.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be ever careful, Dalton-san.Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.48,0:05:31.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just call us again if anything happens!Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They are not actual soldiers?Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.57,0:05:37.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Civilians.Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come join me at my house.Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.61,0:05:44.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look, Luffy! The hiking bear!Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.03,0:05:45.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Again?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.16,0:05:47.29,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Gotta bow.Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.03,0:05:46.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.53,0:05:48.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard there were pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.41,0:05:49.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.91,0:05:53.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, all is in order. There is nothing to fret over.Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.83,0:05:56.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Dalton-kun!Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.42,0:05:58.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I look forward to the election in two days!Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.09,0:06:01.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone says they're voting for you!Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.63,0:06:04.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Y-You cannot be serious! I...Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am no longer worthy of such honor!Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.81,0:06:16.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please lay her on that bed. I will warm the place up.Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,As for introductions,Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.19,0:06:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,I am Dalton,Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.61,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,this island's civilian garrison commander.Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please forgive our hostile reception.Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.87,0:06:30.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,May I ask you a question?Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.79,0:06:35.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I cannot shake the feeling that I have seen you before.Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.92,0:06:39.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-It must be your imagination!Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.46,0:06:42.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, please tell us about this witch!Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.13,0:06:46.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just checked Nami-san's fever, and it has reached 42 degrees!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.26,0:06:48.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-It is... 42 degrees?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.80,0:06:51.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For three days now, her fever has only risen.Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.77,0:06:54.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it rises any more, she'll die!Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.48,0:06:55.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.73,0:07:00.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we don't know the cause of her illness, or how to treat it.Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.32,0:07:02.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We just need a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.74,0:07:05.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Any doctor! Where is this witch of yours?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The witch, you ask?Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.53,0:07:08.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See those mountains through the window?Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.03,0:07:11.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, those insanely tall–Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.41,0:07:14.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hyper Snowman!Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.79,0:07:16.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Snowzilla, the snow beast!Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.25,0:07:18.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.42,0:07:20.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're really asking for it!Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.30,0:07:25.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those mountains are known as the Drum Rockies.Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.42,0:07:28.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you see the castle on the highest peak in the middle?Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.39,0:07:31.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Castle?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.31,0:07:33.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That castle no longer has a king.Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.14,0:07:33.98,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Man, this warms you up.Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.98,0:07:35.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see it.Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.35,0:07:38.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why tell us about the castle?Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.15,0:07:39.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,People call her a witch.Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.65,0:07:44.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only doctor in the land, Dr. Kureha, lives there.Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.94,0:07:45.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.36,0:07:49.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of all the places, why does it have to be so far away?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.20,0:07:50.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, so call her right now!Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.95,0:07:51.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's urgent!Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.91,0:07:54.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would, but there is no way to contact her.Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.37,0:07:55.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And she calls herself a doctor?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.12,0:07:58.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell is she like?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.69,0:08:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a doctor, her skills are unparalleled.Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.00,0:08:03.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But she is an eccentric old hag.Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.96,0:08:06.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's nearly 140 years old now.Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.22,0:08:07.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.05,0:08:09.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sh-She's 140?! And she's still kicking?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.97,0:08:13.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And, come to think of it, she likes pickled plums.Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.22,0:08:16.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happens when people here get sick or injured?Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.44,0:08:19.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She descends the mountain according to her whims.Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.06,0:08:22.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She finds patients, treats them, and then as payment,Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.19,0:08:26.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,she takes whatever she wants from their houses before leaving.Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.74,0:08:31.20,Note-207-,,0,0,0,,"To attain enlightenment, be one with absolute truth."Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.74,0:08:29.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sounds like an unfriendly old hag!Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! She almost sounds like a pirate!Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.74,0:08:34.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But how does such an old woman come down that mountain?Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.70,0:08:37.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is an odd rumor,Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.96,0:08:41.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but several people claim to have seen herDialogue: 50,0:08:41.00,0:08:45.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,riding a sleigh through the sky on moonlit nights.Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.80,0:08:50.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that is why she is called a witch.Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.26,0:08:56.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Some have also seen her with a strange, uncatalogued creature.Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.06,0:09:02.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew it! See? It's a yeti! It's a snowy mountain, after all!Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.15,0:09:03.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew there'd be one!Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.52,0:09:05.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A witch and a yeti?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, please never let us run into them!Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.11,0:09:11.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,While she is the only doctor,Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.07,0:09:13.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would prefer to steer clear of that hag.Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.37,0:09:17.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is best to wait until she comes down the mountain.Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.66,0:09:18.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious...Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.00,0:09:22.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! It'll be too late by then!Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.33,0:09:24.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even as we speak, Nami-san is–Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.29,0:09:27.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami! Nami! Can you hear me?Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.13,0:09:29.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Hey! What are you doing?! – Hey! What are you doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.26,0:09:34.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! She's awake!Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.85,0:09:38.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey there. The only doctor here lives on top of a mountain.Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.10,0:09:39.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're gonna climb it!Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.31,0:09:39.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.98,0:09:41.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think for once!Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know what you're doing with Nami?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.35,0:09:44.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay! I'll carry her on my back!Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.94,0:09:47.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That will only worsen her condition!Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.44,0:09:50.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why's that? We gotta hurry, don't we?Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.40,0:09:52.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,True, but you want the impossible!Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.36,0:09:54.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at how tall and steep it is!Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.53,0:09:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can make it.Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.41,0:09:58.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can make it, but it'd be too hard on Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.70,0:10:02.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But hey! If we fall, the snow will cushion our landing!Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A fall from that mountain would kill even a healthy person!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.25,0:10:10.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, now! She's 6 degrees above normal temperature!Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does that even register with you?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.01,0:10:20.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need... to get better quickly.Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.27,0:10:25.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to hurry... for Vivi.Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Captain!Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.12,0:10:39.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's more like it! Just leave it to me!Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.66,0:10:46.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like captain, like navigator!Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.29,0:10:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how sick you are, Nami-san?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.67,0:10:51.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure about this? That climb will take hours!Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.51,0:10:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old guy! Meat! Gimme meat!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Meat?Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right! I'm going too!Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.30,0:10:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.97,0:11:02.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't slip, trip, or fall even once, or that's it for Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.29,0:11:04.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha...?! Even once?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.10,0:11:05.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hold still!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.98,0:11:07.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to tie this just right!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.94,0:11:10.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All set.Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.19,0:11:12.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, I will wait here.Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.65,0:11:14.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would hate to get in the way.Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Same here!Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.32,0:11:16.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.16,0:11:19.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, Nami! Hold on tight!Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.08,0:11:23.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If your hearts are set on this...Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.83,0:11:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will not stop you.Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.66,0:11:28.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But please begin your climb from the back end.Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.33,0:11:30.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are lapins on this side.Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.30,0:11:33.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fierce, carnivorous rabbits.Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.71,0:11:36.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A pack of them spells certain death.Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.84,0:11:39.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Rabbits? But we're in a hurry.Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.43,0:11:41.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine. Right?Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.18,0:11:42.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'll kick them!Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.85,0:11:44.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Kick them"?! Ridiculous!Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.73,0:11:46.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do not throw away your lives!Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.23,0:11:47.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.39,0:11:50.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, then! Let's go, Sanji!  Before Nami dies!Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.90,0:11:54.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't jinx us like that, you moron!Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.74,0:11:59.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Will they really be all right?Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.41,0:12:02.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... no need to worry about those two.Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.74,0:12:06.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The question is, will Nami-san keep up her strength?Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.50,0:12:08.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish them safe travels.Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.97,0:12:24.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come inside. The cold is biting.Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.39,0:12:27.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's okay. I want to stay outside.Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.98,0:12:28.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Me, too.Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.65,0:12:35.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.87,0:12:43.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then I will join you.Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.13,0:12:57.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We did have some, long ago...Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.67,0:12:58.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.97,0:13:00.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctors.Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.55,0:13:03.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But circumstances are such that they could not remain.Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.26,0:13:06.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This country was...Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.85,0:13:10.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,utterly destroyed mere months ago...Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.10,0:13:11.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,at the hands of pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.73,0:13:12.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.86,0:13:13.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The entire country?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.48,0:13:18.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That explains why everyone was so nervous about us.Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.65,0:13:19.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.95,0:13:24.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The word "pirate" is itself enough to cause everyone unease.Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For that, I am sorry.Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That pirate group was only five strong.Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.08,0:13:32.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The captain called himself "Blackbeard,"Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.29,0:13:36.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and he savagely devastated our country in the blink of an eye.Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.55,0:13:40.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Only five pirates?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.76,0:13:41.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's unimaginable!Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.93,0:13:43.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.51,0:13:47.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But some say it was a blessing  in disguise for this country.Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.39,0:13:49.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How is the destruction of one's homeland a blessing?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.68,0:13:52.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Who'd actually say something so stupid?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.06,0:13:55.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you.Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Until the destruction,Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.40,0:14:02.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this land was subject to a king, one whom the citizens could not abide.Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.53,0:14:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This land was once called the Kingdom of Drum!Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.95,0:14:09.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The king's name was Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.87,0:14:11.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was the worst king possible!Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.63,0:14:19.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes! That man! I remember him!Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.55,0:14:20.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.68,0:14:31.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's getting colder. The wind's picking up.Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.31,0:14:36.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you aren't wearing shoes?! Just seeing that is painful!Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.61,0:14:38.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, it's my police!Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.40,0:14:40.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Police"?! You mean "policy"!Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.94,0:14:42.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the one!Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.11,0:14:48.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, did you know? People living in snowy countries never sleep!Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why's that?Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.58,0:14:51.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Cause they'll die if they sleep!Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.95,0:14:54.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for that! There's nobody like that!Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.50,0:14:57.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's true though! Someone told me a long time ago!Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.42,0:15:00.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp, I bet.Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.71,0:15:02.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope! I heard it at a pub in my village!Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.59,0:15:08.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then explain why Dalton has a bed in his house!Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.47,0:15:11.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.35,0:15:13.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, maybe it's for when he dies!Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.15,0:15:18.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's definitely wrong.Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.52,0:15:22.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay, did you know this?Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.32,0:15:25.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Women in snowy lands all have silky-smooth skin!Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.53,0:15:26.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How come?Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.61,0:15:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.37,0:15:31.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whenever you're cold, you rub your skin for warmth.Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.66,0:15:34.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's how it gets so smooth.Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.41,0:15:39.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So women in snowy places have such silky-smooth, white skin!Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.75,0:15:41.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How come it's white?Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.59,0:15:46.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because their skin absorbs the snow and takes on its characteristics!Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.97,0:15:49.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?! I never knew you were so dumb!Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.60,0:15:51.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Like you're anyone to talk!Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.76,0:15:52.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.85,0:15:56.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,quit being so damn annoying!Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.02,0:15:57.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was with that guy?Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.48,0:16:06.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Nami-san! We're gonna get you to a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.11,0:16:09.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The snow's really deep around here.Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.41,0:16:10.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.74,0:16:14.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't jostle Nami-san! You'll make her worse!Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.46,0:16:22.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are they?Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.09,0:16:24.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're big white polar bears!Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it!Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.09,0:16:27.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.26,0:16:29.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know Wapol?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.72,0:16:31.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't just know him!Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.64,0:16:35.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's the pirate who attacked our ship!Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.31,0:16:36.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I ran him off, though.Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.60,0:16:41.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Y'know, I think he said something about the Kingdom of Drum.Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.15,0:16:42.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.36,0:16:45.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no question about it! I remember clearly now!Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.36,0:16:49.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When I was a child, my father took me to a meeting of many rulers,Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.16,0:16:51.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which is where I met him!Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.24,0:16:54.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A meeting of rulers?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.29,0:16:56.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just who are you?Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.87,0:16:59.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...! No, that was...Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.04,0:17:02.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In any case, we met Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.88,0:17:05.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, on our way here!Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.88,0:17:08.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yesterday?! Are you certain?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.84,0:17:11.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... what's happening, then?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.55,0:17:14.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He called himself a pirate, not a king!Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.01,0:17:18.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The pirate story sounds like a cover.Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.10,0:17:22.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol is merely wandering the sea, trying to return to this island.Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.31,0:17:29.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, the people on that ship were exiled when they failed to drive off Blackbeard?Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Failed? If only!Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.74,0:17:33.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.70,0:17:36.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When it happened, Wapol's armyDialogue: 50,0:17:36.12,0:17:37.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,did nothing to resist them!Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.25,0:17:40.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact,Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.71,0:17:44.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he saw the pirates' strength and immediately abandoned the country!Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.33,0:17:48.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol was the very first to flee out to sea!Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The entire nation despaired.Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.05,0:17:53.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this what the king–Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.64,0:17:56.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that what the king of an entire country does?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.10,0:18:01.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's appalling that a king would abandon his people!Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.89,0:18:04.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi...Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.02,0:18:05.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are exactly right.Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.27,0:18:09.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If anything, Wapol's tyranny is finally over.Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.19,0:18:15.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those remaining on the island are working to create a new nation.Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.20,0:18:21.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And so the thing we fear most is Wapol's return.Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.25,0:18:23.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The return of his reign.Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.17,0:18:24.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The people are uneasy...Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.88,0:18:26.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He cannot be allowed to return!Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.13,0:18:30.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that is if we are to create a new, peaceful nation on this island!Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.72,0:18:37.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It jumped!Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What gives?! How can it move like that?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.69,0:18:46.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it, a gorilla?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.94,0:18:48.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! A polar bear!Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.82,0:18:49.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a bunny!Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.11,0:18:52.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it's not a gorilla, then?Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.15,0:18:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These must be the lapins that Dalton mentioned!Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... this many?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.29,0:19:02.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh!Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.58,0:19:06.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! Wapol, my liege!Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.54,0:19:08.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it, Chess?Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.04,0:19:09.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you find Straw Hat's ship?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.96,0:19:14.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Actually, Your Majesty, we've finally returned home!Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.38,0:19:19.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How many months did we spend wandering the sea?Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.01,0:19:22.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's our homeland! Drum Island!Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.47,0:19:24.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Truly?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.52,0:19:31.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.86,0:19:35.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have to reach that doctor's castle, no matter what.Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare fight them.Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.24,0:19:42.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why not?Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.20,0:19:45.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Whether you attack or get struck,Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.91,0:19:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san will feel the whole impact too!Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.42,0:19:52.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She'll die.Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.13,0:19:54.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.30,0:19:57.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,O-Okay! I won't fight!Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.84,0:20:01.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,B-But, what do I do?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.93,0:20:07.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just dodge! Dodge, dodge, dodge and run!Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.23,0:20:08.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But don't retreat!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.40,0:20:10.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's really hard!Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.07,0:20:13.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Flanchet Shoot!Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.53,0:20:19.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.61,0:20:22.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This snow makes it difficult to deliver a decent kick!Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.21,0:20:29.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're all attacking at once!Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.38,0:20:32.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Head for the woods! I'll cover you!Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.00,0:20:32.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.34,0:20:37.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go left! To the mountain!Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.80,0:20:38.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.55,0:20:39.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll shake 'em off somehow!Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.22,0:20:43.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It'd take us till night to finish them off!Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.68,0:20:45.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These snow mountain beasts don't let up!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.64,0:20:47.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're at a disadvantage.Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.27,0:20:50.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I said don't!Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiot! I told you not to fight them!Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.11,0:20:58.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just leave them to me!Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.11,0:20:59.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry.Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.03,0:21:00.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take this seriously!Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.36,0:21:03.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! There's a way up!Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.28,0:21:05.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good! Go on ahead!Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Up and over!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.21,0:21:17.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You don't need to egg 'em on!Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.26,0:21:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're coming!Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.96,0:21:20.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just run! All the way to the top!Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.51,0:21:24.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's getting worse...Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.48,0:21:28.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! Please be safe!Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.30,0:21:29.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.35,0:21:31.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.65,0:21:32.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gotta bow.Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.27,0:21:34.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello there.Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.31,0:21:36.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard you're looking for Dr. Kureha?Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.86,0:21:39.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, you heard correctly, but the sick person–Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.90,0:21:44.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I heard that right now she's in the neighboring town of Cocoa Weed.Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.83,0:21:47.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What the heck?! – What the heck?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.33,0:21:49.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then they passed each other?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.67,0:22:00.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, shopkeeper. We've had enough already!Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.47,0:22:03.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get your kid to shut it! He's driving me nuts!Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.51,0:22:05.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm sorry.Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.14,0:22:07.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tamachibi, what's wrong?Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.93,0:22:09.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt somewhere?Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.56,0:22:12.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crying won't get to the bottom of this!Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.81,0:22:14.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're disturbing our customers!Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.98,0:22:18.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tamachibi! Say something!Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.36,0:22:20.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep crying and I'll lock you outside!Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.82,0:22:22.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the witch!Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shh! She can hear you!Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.32,0:22:25.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Scary...Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.53,0:22:28.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's with that creepy monster again.Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.54,0:22:34.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's enough!Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.13,0:22:38.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, well. Seems we have a bad father.Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.09,0:22:43.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If a child keeps crying, it's a signal that something is wrong with his body.Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.55,0:22:48.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stand back, Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.89,0:22:55.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.85,0:22:56.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D-Doc–Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.27,0:22:58.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are ya happy, kiddos?Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.86,0:23:05.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha!Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.20,0:23:07.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The secret to my youth?Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.16,0:23:08.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! We didn't ask that!Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.02,0:23:11.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe she's a 140-year-old ha–Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.20,0:23:14.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm only 139 years young!Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.26,0:23:18.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shall I make it better?Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.47,0:23:21.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha...?! Make what better?Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.04,0:23:22.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He isn't sick or anything.Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.53,0:23:26.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you're... a doctor?Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.89,0:23:29.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well then, shall we go, Chopper?Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.30,0:23:32.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,P-Please wait!Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.73,0:23:38.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forgive me. I made an error.Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.53,0:23:43.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Since I heard that the doctor came down the mountain yesterday,Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.49,0:23:46.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I assumed some time would pass before her next visit.Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.37,0:23:49.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. It's not your fault.Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.48,0:23:52.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The real problem is Luffy and Sanji's superhuman strength.Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.48,0:23:57.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if we chased after them, we'd be hard pressed to catch up.Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.46,0:24:00.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If the witch is in this Cocoa Weed town,Dialogue: 50,0:24:00.66,0:24:03.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we gotta ask her to go right back to the castle!Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.39,0:24:08.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, we do. It's our only option.Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.28,0:24:09.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forgive us.Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.64,0:24:10.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.57,0:24:13.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forgive this country for its lack of doctors.Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.21,0:24:17.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-No... You needn't apologize for that, Dalton-san.Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.24,0:24:18.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's right.Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.56,0:24:22.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.66,0:24:35.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My hands... hurt...Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.46,0:24:38.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your hands, you say? I see.Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.23,0:24:39.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, how about now?Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.29,0:24:41.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My leg hurts!Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.21,0:24:44.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See? You forgot that your hands hurt, right?Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.57,0:24:46.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell, lady?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.81,0:24:47.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are ya happy?Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.93,0:24:49.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are happy? Good!Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.55,0:24:50.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, pipe down.Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.77,0:24:52.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.08,0:24:56.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Put a sock in it. I barely touched his leg.Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.02,0:24:57.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But the sound he made...Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.27,0:25:01.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His limbs are tender to the touch.Dialogue: 50,0:25:01.21,0:25:02.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no fever,Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.28,0:25:06.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but the leg's swollen from a purulent inflammation.Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.50,0:25:08.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's gotten pretty bad.Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.15,0:25:11.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The bone's been infected.Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.10,0:25:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper, get the antibiotics.Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.96,0:25:17.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor... will my son be...?Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.19,0:25:20.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Early diagnosis and treatment is key in nixing this disease.Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.48,0:25:22.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He'll be cured...Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.36,0:25:24.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even though he almost died.Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.32,0:25:25.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! "Almost died"?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.32,0:25:28.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold still; I'm making a small incision.Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.67,0:25:30.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about anesthesia?!Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.80,0:25:33.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here's the shot.Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.53,0:25:34.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be so rough!Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.89,0:25:41.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, then... My medicine is highly effective,Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.31,0:25:43.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so that's it for treatment.Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.28,0:25:46.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Make sure he gets plenty of rest and keep his legs bandaged snugly.Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.47,0:25:48.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh...Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.26,0:25:51.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If the limbs get stiff, put ice on them. Got it?Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.70,0:25:54.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As for the fee, well...Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.20,0:25:57.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm running low on trash bags and toilet paper.Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.73,0:26:00.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Also, I'll take all the plum wine and food that you have.Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.77,0:26:02.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Additionally...Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.12,0:26:05.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm claiming fifty percent of this shop's assets.Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.50,0:26:06.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.54,0:26:08.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper... take them to our sled.Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.60,0:26:12.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha...?! You can't be serious! You'd take half my assets?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.50,0:26:14.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, shopkeeper! Don't let her rip you off like that!Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.79,0:26:15.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what she's doing!Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.21,0:26:19.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,"Almost died"?! He was most likely crying because he took a spill!Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.24,0:26:22.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you abuse your position!Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.09,0:26:22.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right!Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.80,0:26:24.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the worst!Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.98,0:26:28.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't take advantage of people's weaknesses, witch!Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.57,0:26:31.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cool it, Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:26:31.78,0:26:33.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just a bunch of bellyaching babies.Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.58,0:26:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Old lady...Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.54,0:26:39.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel a lot better.Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.04,0:26:41.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.87,0:26:48.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh? I got a good tip.Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.32,0:26:51.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll reduce the fee to forty-nine percent.Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.62,0:26:56.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you. Thank you.Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.64,0:27:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! Hey, kiddo.Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.64,0:27:05.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Always remember... how happy you were in this moment, okay?Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.76,0:27:08.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.50,0:27:18.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's ice cold!Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.44,0:27:22.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My body's going numb like it's encased in ice!Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.54,0:27:25.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gotta train harder.Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.10,0:27:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I can attain mindlessness, fire will be cool, and ice will be warm.Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.52,0:27:34.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Karoo! Jump on in!Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.73,0:27:36.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's an opportunity to strengthen your body!Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.05,0:27:55.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see this many fish.Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.32,0:27:57.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time for another lap.Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.27,0:28:01.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They coming?Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.16,0:28:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, they aren't.Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.66,0:28:06.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright! Looks like we lost them.Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.38,0:28:08.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No... not yet.Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.00,0:28:08.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.92,0:28:10.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They keep coming!Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.26,0:28:20.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What're they doing?Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.73,0:28:30.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are they mad because they're hungry?Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.71,0:28:31.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 50,0:28:31.99,0:28:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec...Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.21,0:28:37.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me... they're...!Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.45,0:28:50.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're here! We've finally returned to my country:Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.21,0:28:52.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the Kingdom of Drum!Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.03,0:29:00.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Humph! Civilian guards are no match for a true military.Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.12,0:29:01.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They shot at us!Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.87,0:29:04.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What in the world were they thinking?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.35,0:29:08.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear Drum Island!Dialogue: 50,0:29:08.47,0:29:11.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My, how your nature towers majestically!Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.17,0:29:14.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chess, is the castle intact?Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.11,0:29:15.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Indeed.Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.26,0:29:18.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It remains unchanged, just as we left it, Your Majesty.Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.39,0:29:23.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, let's return there! Onward! To the castle!Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.75,0:29:27.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm done being a pirate! I'm going back to being a king!Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.88,0:29:30.58,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,Now, go forth, Robson!Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.51,0:29:34.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.81,0:29:36.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Robson!Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.52,0:29:38.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why're you just standing around?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.13,0:29:41.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, get moving already!Dialogue: 50,0:29:41.14,0:29:44.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol! There's a problem!Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.22,0:29:45.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 50,0:29:45.30,0:29:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At the riverbank!Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.53,0:29:50.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's that pirate ship from before!Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.06,0:29:50.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.85,0:29:52.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.56,0:29:56.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are those Straw Hats in my country?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.20,0:29:59.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They said they didn't know where it was, yet here they are!Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.95,0:30:04.62,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Go flying!Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.62,0:30:08.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't they know the trouble they put me through after that?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.90,0:30:11.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Go kill them already!Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.75,0:30:14.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, no one's aboard!Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.46,0:30:15.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:15.09,0:30:16.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're just gone!Dialogue: 50,0:30:16.13,0:30:18.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be executed?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.34,0:30:20.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies, King Wapol.Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.99,0:30:23.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please forgive this bumbling subordinate.Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.94,0:30:26.26,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,Chess. Kuromarimo.Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.63,0:30:28.72,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,The two of us personally inspectedDialogue: 50,0:30:28.72,0:30:31.08,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,the footprints leading from the ship.Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.08,0:30:34.69,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,It looks like they headed to Bighorn.Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.69,0:30:38.24,Main-207-,,0,0,10,,Clearly, you're a couple of geniuses.Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.41,0:30:42.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then... let's go to BighornDialogue: 50,0:30:42.66,0:30:46.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and fire off a celebratory salute to the Kingdom of Drum's restoration!Dialogue: 50,0:30:52.01,0:30:55.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha...?! Say what?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.08,0:30:57.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She already left town?!Dialogue: 50,0:30:57.24,0:30:59.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And just moments ago?Dialogue: 50,0:30:59.70,0:31:01.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud!Dialogue: 50,0:31:01.28,0:31:03.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She made me better earlier.Dialogue: 50,0:31:06.27,0:31:09.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for the doctor, Dalton-san?Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.71,0:31:11.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency.Dialogue: 50,0:31:11.26,0:31:13.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you know her next destination?Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.19,0:31:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for Dr. Kureha,Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.92,0:31:17.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,someone said she headed to Gyasta.Dialogue: 50,0:31:17.98,0:31:19.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Gyasta?Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.01,0:31:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's that?Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.45,0:31:24.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,From the center, Bighorn, it is in the opposite direction of this town.Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.27,0:31:26.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So then we passed her again?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:26.53,0:31:27.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ice-skating is popular there.Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.95,0:31:29.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How does that fact help us?Dialogue: 50,0:31:29.80,0:31:30.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And we didn't ask, either!Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.56,0:31:32.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Usopp-san!Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.20,0:31:32.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.73,0:31:34.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then let's go.Dialogue: 50,0:31:34.27,0:31:36.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We've come this far; we haven't a moment to lose!Dialogue: 50,0:31:36.57,0:31:38.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.Dialogue: 50,0:31:38.45,0:31:40.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san...!Dialogue: 50,0:31:41.78,0:31:43.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There you are.Dialogue: 50,0:31:43.41,0:31:45.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You are... supposed to stand watch today, correct?Dialogue: 50,0:31:47.75,0:31:49.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?! What is it?Dialogue: 50,0:31:49.81,0:31:52.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How did you sustain such injuries?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:52.29,0:31:53.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every guard except me...Dialogue: 50,0:31:54.52,0:31:56.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was killed!Dialogue: 50,0:31:56.15,0:31:56.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:56.82,0:31:57.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Suddenly...Dialogue: 50,0:31:58.54,0:32:01.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a submarine sailboat appeared...Dialogue: 50,0:32:02.76,0:32:05.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and everyone... they killed them all!Dialogue: 50,0:32:05.76,0:32:08.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who do you mean by "they"? Calm down and explain.Dialogue: 50,0:32:09.39,0:32:11.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san! Help!Dialogue: 50,0:32:11.95,0:32:14.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not strong enough!Dialogue: 50,0:32:14.00,0:32:15.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something...Dialogue: 50,0:32:16.09,0:32:16.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 50,0:32:18.76,0:32:19.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Them?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.96,0:32:24.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Wapol! Wapol came back!Dialogue: 50,0:32:24.56,0:32:25.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did he just say?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:25.62,0:32:26.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.64,0:32:27.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that true?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:30.55,0:32:31.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:32:32.11,0:32:33.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton-san!Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.66,0:32:40.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I will settle this!Dialogue: 50,0:32:42.06,0:32:45.61,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Justice... I seek no such thing.Dialogue: 50,0:32:46.24,0:32:47.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,After all,Dialogue: 50,0:32:48.31,0:32:50.16,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,you and I equally shoulder the blame!Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.73,0:32:57.79,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Just you wait... Wapol!Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:34.69,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Adventure in a Nameless CountryDialogue: 1,0:03:30.69,0:03:34.69,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Adventure in a Nameless CountryDialogue: 0,0:04:46.85,0:04:52.77,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bighorn Town of SnowDialogue: 1,0:04:46.85,0:04:52.77,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Bighorn Town of SnowDialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:24.61,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Commander Dalton Civilian Garrison Drum IslandDialogue: 1,0:06:19.98,0:06:24.61,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Commander Dalton Civilian Garrison Drum IslandDialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:52.79,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Cocoa Weed The Next Town OverDialogue: 1,0:21:49.04,0:21:52.79,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Cocoa Weed The Next Town OverDialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:02.69,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha Master Physician (Age 139)Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.19,0:23:02.69,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha Master Physician (Age 139)Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.19,0:23:02.69,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Tony Tony Chopper Dr. Kureha's  Beloved ReindeerDialogue: 1,0:22:59.15,0:23:02.69,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Tony Tony Choppe